config ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_ACCELERATION
    bool "Pointer acceleration input processor"
    default y
    depends on DT_HAS_ZMK_INPUT_PROCESSOR_ACCELERATION_ENABLED
    depends on ZMK_POINTING
    help
      Scales relative motion by how fast the pointing device is moving, so
      a slow roll gives a fine step for aiming and a fast one gives a large
      step for crossing the screen. Attach it to a listener with
      input-processors = <&zip_accel MIN_MULT MAX_MULT>.
